WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-reelshort-6ae152bbbf9d11c475011619 — Episode 64 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-26 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:03.340
Callum, there is nothing left to say to them.

2
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.540
Are you Mr. Everts Sterling?

3
00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:08.780
You know me?

4
00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:12.420
My father Charles Whitlaker used to speak of you.

5
00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.820
Years ago he saved your life in a car accident.

6
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.580
You're a part of the Sterling family?

7
00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:20.180
He is my grandson and the sole heir to the Sterling family.

8
00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.620
Impossible. This is impossible.

9
00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.420
You do not need to know who he is.

10
00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.180
You only need to know that the man you humiliated

11
00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:29.580
holds all of your fates in his hands.

12
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:32.580
As of today Sterling Group is terminating all of

13
00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.580
Alara's positions and clearances.

14
00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:36.380
No! Please give my company one more chance.

15
00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.380
That is my life's work!

16
00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.380
We didn't know if we knew Cal was your grandson.

17
00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.980
We never would have treated him like that.

18
00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:44.780
Cal, I was wrong. I was so wrong.

19
00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:46.580
You don't regret losing me.

20
00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.780
You regret losing the guy who paid for your life.

21
00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:57.250
Cal, I truly love you. Just look at me!

22
00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:01.450
For seven years I waited every single day for you to look my way.

23
00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:02.450
It's too late.
